<title>BOSNIA: SOCCER-BOSNIA 0 GREECE 1 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOSNIA 0 GREECE 1 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece beat Bosnia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in their World Cup European group one qualifier</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Konstantinos Franceskos 74</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
